        "contenuto_esteso": "NASA on Tuesday released a historic image of Earth dipping below the lunar horizon, a so-called \"Earthset\", more than 57 years after an iconic \"Earthrise\" image was captured by an Apollo 8 astronaut during the first human flyby of the Moon. Members of the Artemis II crew captured the image on Monday during the mission's record-setting lunar flyby."
